#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:5
msgid "Close Project"
msgstr "关闭项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:7
msgid ""
"The user can close a `project`_ at any time. If the current work wants to be"
" saved before closing the project, refer to `save`_ section. Even so, "
"QElectroTech display an automatic message to `save project`_ if any "
"modification has been created on it."
msgstr ""
"用户可以随时关闭一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 。 如果当前项目在关闭项目前想要保存，请参考 `保存 <save_>`_ 节。 "
"即使如此，QElectroTech 也会显示一个自动消息给 `save project <save project_>`_，如果已经创建任何修改 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Save message"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 保存信件"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:16
msgid ""
"Closing the current project can be done from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_, "
"`projects panel`_, `projects tab bar`_ and using the corresponding keyboard "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"关闭当前项目可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_，`项目面板 <projects "
"panel_>`_，`项目标签栏 <projects tab bar_>`_ 并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:19
msgid ""
"At the case that more than one `project`_ are opened, the active `project`_ "
"will be the `project`_ which will be closed."
msgstr ""
"如果打开了超过一个 `项目 <project_>`_，则正在运行的 `项目 <project_>`_ 将是将关闭的 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:23
msgid "Close project from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏关闭项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:25
msgid "Select **File > Close** menu item to close the active `project`_."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 关闭** 菜单项关闭活动 `项目 <project_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:30
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech File menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:33
msgid "Close project from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏关闭项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:35
msgid ""
"Select the icon |project-close| from `toolbar`_ to close the active "
"`project`_."
msgstr "选择图标 |project-close| 从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 关闭活动 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:37
msgid "project-close"
msgstr "项目关闭"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:41
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:44
msgid "Close project from projects panel"
msgstr "从项目面板关闭项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:46
msgid ""
"The advantage of closing `projects`_ from `projects panel`_ is the "
"possibility to close `projects`_ which are opened and are not the active "
"`project`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `项目 <projects_>`_ 中关闭 `项目 <projects panel_>`_ 的优点是有可能关闭已开通的 `项目 "
"<projects_>`_，而这些项目不是活动的 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:49
msgid ""
"Right click on the opened `project`_ from the `projects panel`_ tree which "
"should be closed."
msgstr "右键点击应当关闭的 `项目 <project_>`_ 树打开的 `项目 <projects panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:50
msgid "Select **Close this project** to close the selected `project`_."
msgstr "选择 **关闭此项目** 关闭选中的 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:55
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech projects panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech项目小组"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:59
msgid ""
"If the `projects panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**."
msgstr "如果 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 项目** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:62
msgid "Close project from the tab bar"
msgstr "从标签栏关闭项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:64
msgid ""
"All opened `projects`_ can be visible at the `projects tab bar`_ that is "
"displayed atop of the `workspace`_. The user can close an opened "
"`projects`_, regardless of whether the project is active, with a click on "
"the close tab |project_tab_close_tab| from the project tab."
msgstr ""
"所有打开的 `项目 <projects_>`_ 都可以在显示在 `工作空间 <projects tab bar_>`_ 顶端的 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 中可见。用户可以关闭一个打开的 `项目 <projects_>`_，无论项目是否在活动，从项目标签栏点击一个关闭标签 "
"|project_tab_close_tab| 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:88
msgid "project_tab_close_tab"
msgstr "项目  tab  close tab"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:68
msgid ""
"At the case that the `projects`_ are displayed as PopUP windows, they can be"
" closed with a click on the close tab |project_window_close_tab| which is "
"placed at the top right corner."
msgstr ""
"在 `项目 <projects_>`_ 显示为PopUP窗口的情况下，可以点击右上角的关闭标签 |project_window_close_tab| "
"关闭。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:89
msgid "project_window_close_tab"
msgstr "项目窗口关闭  tab"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:73
msgid ""
"Displaying the `projects`_ using a tab bar or using PopUP windows can be "
"chosen at **Display > Display projects**."
msgstr "使用标签栏或使用 PopUP 窗口显示 `项目 <projects_>`_ 可以选择在 **Display > 显示项目** 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:77
msgid "Close project using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键关闭项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:79
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:81
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + f4`` to close the active `project`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + f4`` 关闭活动 `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/close_project.rst:85
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
